dev/null\n+++ b/home/admin_/ARCHITECTURE.md\n@@ -0,0 +1,25 @@\n+# Project Architecture\n+\n+## Overview\n+Provide a high-level summary of the system and its purpose.\n+\n+## Technology Stack\n+- **Language:** Node.js\n+- **Cloud Provider:** Google Cloud Platform (GCS, Vertex AI)\n+- **Key Libraries:** `@google-cloud/storage`, `@google/genai`\n+\n+## Component Breakdown\n+### 1. Storage Layer\n+Uses Google Cloud Storage for persistent object storage. Data integrity is maintained using CRC32C checksums during uploads/downloads.\n+\n+### 2. AI Integration\n+Integrates with Vertex AI / Gemini API for generative tasks.\n+\n+## Data Flow\n+1. User initiates a request via the CLI/Browser.\n+2. Application fetches necessary context/assets from GCS.\n+3. Context is sent to the Gemini API for processing.\n+4. Results are returned to the user and optionally cached back in GCS.\n+\n+## Security \u0026 Compliance\n+- Service Account authentication via Application Default Credentials (ADC).\n+- Customer-Supplied Encryption Keys (CSEK) for sensitive data in GCS.\n```\n\nBy placing this file in your root directory, you provide a clear \"source of truth\" that helps guide any development work or AI-assisted coding sessions.\n\n\u003c!--\n[PROMPT_SUGGESTION]How can I document my API endpoints in this markdown file?[/PROMPT_SUGGESTION]\n[PROMPT_SUGGESTION]Can you help me write a script to automatically validate my GCS uploads against this architecture?[/PROMPT_SUGGESTION]\n--\u003e","chatSectionId":"0","ideContext":{"currentFile":{"path":"/home/admin_/README-cloudshell.txt","language":"plaintext","selection":{"start":913,"end":913},"includedReason":"CURRENTLY_OPEN","isUntitled":false},"remoteContexts":null,"remoteRepositories":[],"otherFiles":[{"path":"/home/admin_/.codeoss/data/User/globalStorage/vscode.json-language-features/json-schema-cache/4fb05fc2ee888011c0d09007cec3153592758adc192613da1edee399e79ce1c6.schema.json","language":"","selection":{"start":0,"end":0},"includedReason":"