ummary of the system and its purpose.\n\n## Technology Stack\n- **Language:** Node.js\n- **Cloud Provider:** Google Cloud Platform (GCS, Vertex AI)\n- **Key Libraries:** `@google-cloud/storage`, `@google/genai`\n\n## Component Breakdown\n### 1. Storage Layer\nUses Google Cloud Storage for persistent object storage. Data integrity is maintained using CRC32C checksums during uploads/downloads.\n\n### 2. AI Integration\nIntegrates with Vertex AI / Gemini API for generative tasks.\n\n## Data Flow\n1. User initiates a request via the CLI/Browser.\n2. Application fetches necessary context/assets from GCS.\n3. Context is sent to the Gemini API for processing.\n4. Results are returned to the user and optionally cached back in GCS.\n\n## Security \u0026 Compliance\n- Service Account authentication via Application Default Credentials (ADC).\n- Customer-Supplied Encryption Keys (CSEK) for sensitive data in GCS.","telemetry":{"CommentLines":null},"codeBlockIndex":0,"language":"markdown","checkpointFileNotFound":true,"accepted":true}]},"fileUsage":{"includedFiles":["/home/admin_/README-cloudshell.txt","/home/admin_/.codeoss/data/User/globalStorage/vscode.json-language-features/json-schema-cache/4fb05fc2ee888011c0d09007cec3153592758adc192613da1edee399e79ce1c6.schema.json","/home/admin_/.local/lib/python3.12/site-packages/google/adk/cli/browser/chunk-NALL4A3P.js","/home/admin_/node_modules/@google-cloud/projectify/README.md","/home/admin_/node_modules/@google-cloud/promisify/README.md","/home/admin_/node_modules/@google-cloud/paginator/README.md","/home/admin_/node_modules/@google-cloud/storage/README.md","/home/admin_/.local/lib/python3.12/site-packages/google/adk/cli/browser/chunk-ZMOC4H7T.js","/home/admin_/node_modules/@google-cloud/storage/build/esm/src/file.js","/home/admin_/node_modules/@google/genai/dist/vertex_internal/index.js","/home/admin_/node_modules/@google-cloud/storage/build/cjs/src/file.js"]},"suggestedPrompts":["How can I document my API endpoints in this markdow