\nI'm now detailing the IAM configurations, specifically the creation of service accounts and assigning them necessary roles like `cloudsql.client` and `aiplatform.user`. My current efforts are concentrated on finalizing the `Dockerfile`, `requirements.txt`, and the deployment markdown, ensuring they align with the master architecture.\n\n","id":"bb97fb35-71be-4ee1-8938-a17f5380cad3","agentMetadata":{"coderAgent":{"kind":""},"model":""},"modelDisplayName":"3 Flash Preview","modelID":"chat-gemini-3-0-flash-preview-free-tier","usageMetadata":{"promptTokenCount":178682,"candidatesTokenCount":2167,"totalTokenCount":180849}}],"threadId":"145d392d-7116-11f1-b47d-be52222f64e6","usageMetadata":{"promptTokenCount":178682,"candidatesTokenCount":2167,"totalTokenCount":180849}}
