onfiguring Cloud Infrastructure**\n\nI'm now detailing the IAM configurations, specifically the creation of service accounts and assigning them necessary roles like `cloudsql.client` and `aiplatform.user`. My current efforts are concentrated on finalizing the `Dockerfile`, `requirements.txt`, and the deployment markdown, ensuring they align with the master architecture.\n\n","id":"bb97fb35-71be-4ee1-8938-a17f5380cad3","agentMetadata":{"coderAgent":{"kind":""},"model":""},"modelDisplayName":"3 Flash Preview","modelID":"chat-gemini-3-0-flash-preview-free-tier","usageMetadata":{"promptTokenCount":178682,"candidatesTokenCount":2167,"totalTokenCount":180849}},{"entity":"USER","markdownText":"can we push this to github? we have not saved this local either, it only exists in the cloud shell","chatSectionId":"4","ideContext":{"currentFile":{"path":"/home/admin_/schemas.py","language":"python","selection":{"start":0,"end":0},"includedReason":"CURRENTLY_OPEN"},"remoteContexts":null,"remoteRepositories":[],"otherFiles":[{"path":"/home/admin_/ArchitecureII.md","language":"markdown","selection":{"start":0,"end":0},"includedReason":"RECENTLY_EDITED"},{"path":"/home/admin_/models.py","language":"python","selection":{"start":0,"end":0},"includedReason":"RECENTLY_EDITED"},{"path":"/home/admin_/database.py","language":"python","selection":{"start":0,"end":0},"includedReason":"RECENTLY_EDITED"},{"path":"/home/admin_/dependencies.py","language":"python","selection":{"start":0,"end":0},"includedReason":"RECENTLY_EDITED"},{"path":"/home/admin_/main.py","language":"python","selection":{"start":0,"end":0},"includedReason":"RECENTLY_EDITED"},{"path":"/home/admin_/tasks.py","language":"python","selection":{"start":0,"end":0},"includedReason":"RECENTLY_EDITED"},{"path":"/home/admin_/cache.py","language":"python","selection":{"start":0,"end":0},"includedReason":"RECENTLY_EDITED"},{"path":"/home/admin_/Dockerfile","language":"dockerfile","selection":{"start":0,"end":0},"includedReason":"CHAT_SU