ash\n    # Rename your branch to main and push\n    git branch -M main\n    git push -u origin main\n    ```\n\n### Important Security Note\nSince this project involves **HIPAA-compliant** and **Military-Grade** specifications as outlined in `ArchitecureII.md`, ensure the GitHub repository is set to **Private**. Do not include any `.json` service account keys or actual secret values in your files before pushing; ensure you continue to rely on the environment variables defined in your `deployment.md`.\n\n\u003c!--\n[PROMPT_SUGGESTION]How can I set up a GitHub Action to automatically run the health check from main.py on every push?[/PROMPT_SUGGESTION]\n[PROMPT_SUGGESTION]Can you help me create a README.md for the root directory that summarizes the Node 01 features?[/PROMPT_SUGGESTION]\n--\u003e","chatSectionId":"4","ideContext":{"currentFile":{"path":"/home/admin_/schemas.py","language":"python","selection":{"start":0,"end":0},"includedReason":"CURRENTLY_OPEN"},"remoteContexts":null,"remoteRepositories":[],"otherFiles":[{"path":"/home/admin_/ArchitecureII.md","language":"markdown","selection":{"start":0,"end":0},"includedReason":"RECENTLY_EDITED"},{"path":"/home/admin_/models.py","language":"python","selection":{"start":0,"end":0},"includedReason":"RECENTLY_EDITED"},{"path":"/home/admin_/database.py","language":"python","selection":{"start":0,"end":0},"includedReason":"RECENTLY_EDITED"},{"path":"/home/admin_/dependencies.py","language":"python","selection":{"start":0,"end":0},"includedReason":"RECENTLY_EDITED"},{"path":"/home/admin_/main.py","language":"python","selection":{"start":0,"end":0},"includedReason":"RECENTLY_EDITED"},{"path":"/home/admin_/tasks.py","language":"python","selection":{"start":0,"end":0},"includedReason":"RECENTLY_EDITED"},{"path":"/home/admin_/cache.py","language":"python","selection":{"start":0,"end":0},"includedReason":"RECENTLY_EDITED"},{"path":"/home/admin_/Dockerfile","language":"dockerfile","selection":{"start":0,"end":0},"includedReason"